Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 13:40:04 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1175/1178] HERESY 1167: a song's tools beside New song; the
 browser's language at the first visit; the DAW panel across its width; a
 patient peek; the Librarian's search that narrows, finds sections and takes
 Ctrl+F
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor, 06.10.2026:
· «из выпадающего меню перенести в Creator прямо к кнопке New... все три пункта LOAD/SAVE/EXAMPLE… И Clear the form - тоже
  нахер с бара»: Open, Save, Example and Clear beside New song in the Creator's head; the bar keeps the language, day or
  night, the DAW, Unload and ☰.
· «авто обнаружение языка браузера при первом посещении или сброшенных куках»: with no language kept, the browser's own
  languages in their order, the first the page has; English otherwise.
· «В Out of the Studio (DAW) у тебя жёсткие переносы строк. И здесь +2pt на тексты. Три колонки DAW - расширь их по всей
  ширине»: the panel 1240 px, its texts across it and 2 pt larger, the three DAWs in three equal columns.
· «Попап справа вверху можно растянуть на 200px. Дать ему задержку в пропадании на 1200ms… а при наведении разворачивать
  вниз»: the peek is 580 px wide.
  – It stays while the pointer crosses other cards on its way to it (a card rested on for 400 ms takes its place).
  – It goes 1200 ms after the pointer leaves the cards.
  – Entered, it opens downward: the whole style and the whole lyrics.
· «В топовом воркспейсе… поиск их не видит»: the search filtered every take already (drawn or not). Now it also reads the
  takes' workspaces and sections. Ctrl+F in the Librarian goes to its search (the browser's own sees only the cards drawn).
· «Search box - дай ему авто сжимку до разумных размеров»: a long workspace name no longer wraps the head. The numbers give
  way first (three times faster, into two lines), and the search narrows to 260 px at most. One line from 1400 px.

cdp-console 344/0/7, check-i18n 14/0, check-player 3/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
